'''Lucky Mittens''' (Japanese: '''ラッキーミトン''' ''Lucky Mitten'') is a {{TCGP|Pokémon Tool}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Mega Rising}} expansion.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Tool
|rule=Pocket Tool
|effect=Whenever your opponent's Pokémon is Knocked Out by damage from an attack used by the Pokémon this card is attached to, draw a card.
}}

==Trivia==
* This card's effect can be thought of as the inverse of {{TCG|Lucky Helmet}} in the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]]. Both are Pokémon Tool cards that allow the player to draw a card if the Pokémon they are attached to is attacking or is being attacked.
